# Auto-generated at runtime by GR1T2FourierUDCAPDevice._generate_runtime_manifest.
# Contains the absolute path to the active conda env's python.exe so SteamVR
# accepts the application entry (the static template ships with a placeholder
# binary_path that SteamVR resolves to <config>/python.exe and silently
# rejects).  Regenerated every launch — safe to delete.
manifest.runtime.vrmanifest
